---
title: Milestone planning
---
flowchart TD
    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#000
    classDef role fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#000
    classDef channel fill:#dff0d8,stroke:#3c763d,color:#000
    classDef stop fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#777,color:#000

    START(["Human asks for the next task"]):::human
    QUEUE{"Any schedulable entry in<br/>.claude/problems.md? — Thinking: and<br/>Owner: present, Decision: Will do,<br/>at any level and whoever filed it"}
    FIRST(["Those come first<br/>— see agent-flow-problem-lifecycle.mmd"]):::stop

    TW["Task writer"]:::role
    ACCEPTED{"Is .claude/task.md empty?<br/>The human empties it once every<br/>subtask has been accepted"}
    KEEP["Leave it alone — the sub-milestone<br/>carrying 🚧 is still being worked,<br/>so there is no task to write.<br/>Never clear or overwrite it yourself"]:::stop
    CLOSE["Empty problems file + accepted task<br/>= the sub-milestone is finished.<br/>Set it 🚧 → ✅ Done in docs/ROADMAP.md.<br/>Sub-milestones only; never a parent"]

    MORE{"Is there a 🆕 New sub-milestone left<br/>under the same parent — or under the next<br/>unfinished parent by number, 🆕 New or<br/>⏸️ Hold alike, if this one has already been<br/>passed ✅ by the Milestone Reviewer?"}
    ASK["Write no task. Say the milestone looks<br/>complete, leave the parent at 🚧, and ask<br/>the human whether to hand the tree to the<br/>Milestone Reviewer. Inventing filler work<br/>is the failure here"]:::stop

    UNCLEAR{"Is the next sub-milestone's shape<br/>settled enough to specify?"}
    ARCH["Architect<br/>investigates: options, dependencies,<br/>what the milestone actually requires"]:::role
    INV["The conclusion lands where it survives:<br/>docs/adr/**, the docs/ROADMAP.md entry<br/>itself, or docs/agent-guide.md"]:::channel

    READ["Reads the docs/ROADMAP.md entry:<br/>Problem, Solution, Done-when,<br/>plus any ADR it names"]
    SPLIT["Decompose into subtasks:<br/>each independently completable<br/>and independently reviewable"]
    ORDER["Order Plan, 1..N, each line<br/>carrying status, SP and Thinking —<br/>if a subtask cannot finish without a<br/>later one, it is two subtasks misordered"]
    WRITE["Write .claude/task.md: title, For:,<br/>Model tier: from the highest Thinking,<br/>then Order Plan with 🆕 New, SP and Thinking;<br/>one section per subtask with how to test it<br/>and a Status: line, no SP in the body.<br/>No rationale — a decision worth explaining<br/>is an ADR, not a task"]
    TASK[".claude/task.md"]:::channel
    STATUS["Set that sub-milestone 🆕 or ⏸️ → 🚧<br/>In Progress in docs/ROADMAP.md, in the same<br/>edit as the ✅ above, and its parent too.<br/>Exactly one parent carries 🚧: a milestone<br/>left incomplete goes ⏸️ Hold in that edit"]
    ROADMAP["docs/ROADMAP.md"]:::channel
    NEXT(["Coder starts subtask 1<br/>— see agent-flow-task-implementation.mmd"]):::stop

    START --> QUEUE
    QUEUE -- yes --> FIRST
    PENDING{"Any entries still awaiting triage<br/>or an approved backlog move?"}
    TRIAGE["Report pending entries; wait for triage"]:::stop
    QUEUE -- no --> PENDING
    PENDING -- yes --> TRIAGE
    PENDING -- no --> TW --> ACCEPTED
    ACCEPTED -- "no, a task is still open" --> KEEP
    ACCEPTED -- yes --> CLOSE --> MORE
    MORE -- no --> ASK
    MORE -- yes --> UNCLEAR
    UNCLEAR -- no --> ARCH --> INV --> READ
    UNCLEAR -- yes --> READ
    READ --> SPLIT --> ORDER --> WRITE --> TASK --> STATUS --> ROADMAP --> NEXT
